rless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Spring\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Spring</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Spring\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Spring</a>:</b> <span style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>2 Pieces Equipped: +10% Artifact bonus to <a href=\"/page/Missile_Deflection\" title=\"Missile Deflection\">Missile Deflection</a></li><li>3 Pieces Equipped: +15% Artifact bonus do damage versus the Helpless</li><li>4 Pieces Equipped: +3% Legendary bonus to Dodge Cap</li><li>5 Pieces Equipped: +3 Artifact bonus to Sneak Attack Dice</li><li>6 Pieces Equipped: +10% Artifact bonus to Doublestrike and Doubleshot</li><li>7 Pieces Equipped: +15 Artifact bonus to Melee and Ranged Power</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Autumn\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Autumn</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Autumn\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Autumn</a>:</b> <span style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>2 Pieces Equipped: +25 Artifact bonus to Universal Spell Power</li><li>3 Pieces Equipped: +6% Artifact bonus to Universal Spell Critical Chance</li><li>4 Pieces Equipped: +10% Legendary bonus to Maximum Spellpoints</li><li>5 Pieces Equipped: +3 Artifact bonus to Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma</li><li>6 Pieces Equipped: +3 Artifact bonus to Spell DCs</li><li>7 Pieces Equipped: +15% Legendary bonus to Universal Spell Critical Damage</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rosethorn_Necklace.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rosethorn_Necklace.png/420px-Rosethorn_Necklace.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"741\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Rosethorn_Necklace.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" styl